# Gate B, DiT: clean baseline + skip the mid 83 steps (indices 84-166 of 250, burn kept) on manifest v1.1
# (224 images), with quality scores. The late arm (167-249) is added here once mid is checked.
#     qsub -v SETTINGS=lanes/p1/jobs/gateb_dit.env lanes/p1/jobs/gateb.pbs
# The step indices become timesteps through this job's own baseline run.json (stages table).
# Outputs: outputs/p1/<JOBID>/. The baseline must match outputs/baseline/25665469/dit row by row.
MANIFEST=manifest/frozen_v1_1.csv
RUN_VAR=0
RUN_DIT=1
DIT_ARMS="remove_mid:84-166"
QUALITY=1
